# One command.<br>A complete server. { .hi-title }

<p class="hi-lead">Hiddify Manager installs the admin panel, 13 services and a security certificate on your Ubuntu server by itself. You only paste one command.</p>

<div class="hi-cmd" markdown="1">

```bash
bash <(curl https://i.hiddify.com/release)
```

</div>

